# Annie Flash, the Veteran is cast with flash during Bot2's turn (CR 702.8a), so her enters ability triggers (CR 603.4): Hill
# Giant (mana value 4), a sorcery and Bot2's Glorious Anthem are refused targets, and Bot1's Glorious Anthem (mana value 3,
# a noncreature permanent card) returns tapped. On Bot1's turn she attacks, becomes tapped and exiles exactly the top two
# cards of Bot1's library (Bot2's library is untouched): the Mountain is played from exile as the turn's land drop and the
# Lightning Bolt is cast from exile with its mana (CR 305.1, 601.2), while the Forest drawn that turn stays in hand.
# Annie Flash, the Veteran {3}{R}{G}{W}: Legendary Creature — Human Rogue 4/5
#   Flash
#   When Annie Flash enters, if you cast it, return target permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the
#   battlefield tapped.
#   Whenever Annie Flash becomes tapped, exile the top two cards of your library. You may play those cards this turn.

